open_url "http://localhost:3000"
step "Sign in. Keep your existing keys (press Enter below), or create new ones:"
step "your project → Settings → API Keys → Create new API keys; copy both."
ask LANGFUSE_PUBLIC_KEY "Langfuse public key (pk-lf-…):"
ask_secret LANGFUSE_SECRET_KEY "Langfuse secret key (sk-lf-…):"
